OverTheWire Bandit: Level 6 → 7

Objective
Obtain the password for Level 7.
The password is stored in a file owned by user bandit7, owned by group bandit6, and 33 bytes in size.

Steps
Log in as bandit6:
ssh bandit6@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220
Search the system for the file with the specified ownership and size:
find / -type f -user bandit7 -group bandit6 -size 33c 2>/dev/null
Read the file:
cat <file-path>

Result
The file contains the password for Bandit Level 7.
